{"slug": "program-portfolio-roadmap-report", "title": "Program/Portfolio Roadmap Report", "category": "Reporting", "categorySlug": "reporting", "date": "Nov 20, 2019", "author": "admin", "image": "https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262860/albatroz/blog/uploads/2019/11/Timeline021Slide1.webp", "excerpt": "A program/portfolio roadmap report gives an overview of projects progress through the different phase gates.", "readTime": 3, "content": "<ul class=\"post-info\">\n                                            <li style=\"list-style:none;padding-bottom:0\"></li>\n                                            <li style=\"list-style:none;padding-bottom:0\"></li>\n                                        </ul>\n                                    </div> -->\n                                    \n<p><b>Business Case:</b><br />\nPortfolio Managers and Program/Project Managers want to see a visual roadmap view of their investments/projects with upcoming gates, milestones, key tasks, tasks slippage from baseline.<br />\nThere are no stock reports in Clarity PPM that provides this kind of a view. Here is a screenshot of a custom report developed by Albatroz Solutions for our customers that needed such a view.</p>\n<p><b>About the Report:</b><br />\nA program/portfolio roadmap report, gives an overview of projects progress through the different phase gates.<br />\nBelow are the key features of the roadmap report:<br />\n1. The report lists the portfolios/programs and the respective projects grouped under them.<br />\n2. The report displays the timeline (<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-827\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262865/albatroz/blog/uploads/2019/11/prj_timeline.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"45\" height=\"31\" />) for each project along with and indicator for the phase gates (<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-829\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262863/albatroz/blog/uploads/2019/11/prj_gate.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"25\" height=\"20\" />) that have been met.<br />\n3. The timeline view on the report can be changed to weekly/monthly/quarterly. For example, the project manager would prefer to have a timeline of weekly for his projects while the program manager or portfolio manager would find the monthly or quarterly view useful.<br />\n4. The report also displays the key tasks duration (<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-828\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262864/albatroz/blog/uploads/2019/11/prj_task.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"45\" height=\"33\" />) along with baseline slippage (<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-830\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262862/albatroz/blog/uploads/2019/11/prj_base.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"45\" height=\"35\" />) helping the project managers with the schedule of the project and possible delays.<br />\nThe report can be run on the project dashboard page with dynamic project filter option to generate the roadmap view only for the project in context. For information about dynamic jasper filters, refer to the article &#8211; <a href=\"https://albatrozsolutions.com/blog/running-jasper-report-in-an-html-portlet-with-dynamic-filter-values/\">Running Jasper Report in an HTML Portlet with Dynamic Filter Values</a></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1707 size-full\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262874/albatroz/blog/uploads/2019/11/roadmap_2-scaled.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1231\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262874/albatroz/blog/uploads/2019/11/roadmap_2-scaled.webp 2560w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262872/albatroz/blog/uploads/2019/11/roadmap_2-300x144.webp 300w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262866/albatroz/blog/uploads/2019/11/roadmap_2-1024x492.webp 1024w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262873/albatroz/blog/uploads/2019/11/roadmap_2-768x369.webp 768w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262868/albatroz/blog/uploads/2019/11/roadmap_2-1536x738.webp 1536w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262870/albatroz/blog/uploads/2019/11/roadmap_2-2048x985.webp 2048w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262867/albatroz/blog/uploads/2019/11/roadmap_2-114x55.webp 114w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262869/albatroz/blog/uploads/2019/11/roadmap_2-200x96.webp 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" /></p>\n<p><b>Author:</b> Gayathri Gupta, PPM Architect<br />\n<b>Contact us:</b><br />\nFor any questions or have enquiries about our report development service offerings please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:info@albatrozsolutions.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">info@albatrozsolutions.com</a> or <a href=\"mailto:balaji@albatrozsolutions.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">balaji@albatrozsolutions.com</a>. We will be glad to help.</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            \n                            <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                                <a href=\"https://albatrozsolutions.com/contact-us/\" style=\"margin-top: 15px;text-align:center;width: auto;\" class=\"banner-btn request_service_button pt-3 cta_btn\">Contact Us</a>\n                            </div>\n                             <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                                <div class=\"social-share-btn\">\n                                                                        <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"share-btn-new clr-1\" href=\"https://x.com/intent/post?url=https%3A%2F%2Falbatrozsolutions.com%2Fblog%2Fprogram-portfolio-roadmap-report%2F\"><img class=\"ex-icon\"